"""Complete QA suite.  Usage:  python -m src.qa_check [--skip-pytest] [--skip-server]

Checks: syntax/import, pytest, dataset validation, leakage + split fingerprints, result-file schemas, metric traceability
(every reported metric is recomputed from a raw predictions file), transformer completeness (no N/A left for an executed
run), report generation, Streamlit (AppTest + headless server), prediction smoke tests. Writes reports/tables/qa_report.{md,json}
and then regenerates reports/FINAL_GPU_REVIEW.md. Exit code 1 if any check FAILS. A transformer that was not executed is
reported as PENDING (never as passed/executed).
"""
